==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 250,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*1 [[Mega-Mooth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*7 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 33.3 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500~700f</sup>.

