==Strategies==
This set of stages involves few, strong enemies, with the difficulty coming from having to defeat them before they pile up, all while Mega-Mooth keeps attacking. For this reason, single target is not quite a problem, meaning that [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] and ubers like [[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Lufalan Pasalan]] will not be hindered by this ability. Other cats should either be meatshields, mid-range attackers like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]] or part of cat combos, the use of which is highly recommended as these stages do not require much variety in terms of cats.

Recommended Ubers and Legends include: Lufalan Pasalan, [[Kasli the Scourge (Uber Rare Cat)|Ritual Saint Kasli]], various rushers, [[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Chronos]], [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]], [[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|King Gamereon]], [[Sodom (Uber Rare Cat)|Sodom]].

